# The lit top course of a platform: moss over stone. Tiles horizontally only.
#
# This is the row the player lands on, so it is the row that gets the light and
# the only one with a second material. Everything below is the plain ground
# tile — spending detail on surfaces nobody walks on is how a tileset gets
# noisy.
name platformer-ground-top
size 16 16
key o outline
key S stone-0-shadow
key m stone-1
key g moss-1
key G moss-2-hilite
pixels
gGgGgGgGgGgGgGgG
GGGGGGGGGGGGGGGG
gGGGGgGGGGGGgGGG
ooggggooogggooog
SSSoooSSSoooSSSo
SmmmSSSmmmmSSSmm
*2 mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm
SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS
*6 mmmmmmmmmmSSmmmm
SSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS
